WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Browse. Keep human-facing browser links beside machine-facing API addresses.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Follow. Catalog and collection links lead toward item metadata.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Inspect. An item describes geometry and time and links to data or thumbnails.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Check access. A working catalog page does not prove every data asset accepts browser requests.
